 result←object(State Rect)arg;tunits;props;t;box
 result←⍬
 ⍝ 'Rect' r c h w [eh ew]
 ⍝ 'Rect' (r c h w [eh ew]) (r c h w [eh ew]) ...
 ⍝ 'Rect' (n m ⍴ r c h w [eh ew] ...) (r c h w [eh ew]) ...

 :If 1≥|≡arg ⋄ arg←,⊂arg ⋄ :EndIf
 '∆WI RANK ERROR: Rect'##.Error∨/2<≢¨⍴¨arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Rect'##.Error∨/~(⊢/¨⍴¨arg)∊¨⊂4 6
 tunits←⊃##.Classes._supp.MyUnits State
 arg←⊃,/,¨↓¨arg ⍝ If any items are matrices, split them into individual lines so we can process them sequentially then recombine into a single matrix
 props←StartObj'Rect'
 props,←DefinePen State
 props,←DefineBrush State
 props,←⊂'DrawMode'(2⊃State._mode)

 :For box :In arg ⍝ Only build one rectangle at a time
     box←box×box≢⍛⍴tunits ⍝ Convert to pixels from object's scale
     State GUI props,('Points'(2↑box))('Size'(2↑2↓box))('Radius'(2↑4↓box))
 :EndFor
